'''DPS:''' 1,961.54 → 3,530.77<br>
'''Range:''' 325 → 400<br>
'''Speed:''' 12 → 18<br>
'''Recharge:''' 24.53s → 91.2s<br>
[[File:Strong Against.png]] [[File:Blacktraiticon.png|40px]] [[File:Floatingtraiticon.png|40px]] [[File:Alientraiticon.png|40px]]<br>
[[File:Freeze.png]] [[File:Blacktraiticon.png|40px]] [[File:Floatingtraiticon.png|40px]] [[File:Alientraiticon.png|40px]] 50% → 100%
}}
